<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">IDEAS & CONCEPTS</p>
    <h1>Physical Form, Modular Hardware & Systems</h1>
    <p>A curated collection of industrial design concepts, modular hardware ecosystems, and material experiments exploring the intersection of physical craft and technology.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="wrap">

  <!-- ===== MODU-PHON SPOTLIGHT ===== -->
  <section class="modu-spotlight" style="margin-top:clamp(48px,8vh,80px)">
    <div class="wrap" style="padding-block:0">
      <div>
        <span class="badge">HARDWARE ECOSYSTEM CONCEPT</span>
        <h2>MODU-PHON</h2>
        <p>A flexible core that adapts to the form, material, and function required by each context. The screen stops dictating a fixed shell — the user inserts the core module into a specialized structure, transforming the device for every scenario.</p>
        <div class="modu-grid">
          <div class="modu-item">
            <b>Daily Use</b>
            <span>Anodized aluminum, ergonomic white polymer, and fashion finishes.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="modu-item">
            <b>Work & Travel</b>
            <span>Executive leather, reinforced protection, and tactile grip.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="modu-item">
            <b>Extended Function</b>
            <span>Photographic grip, desktop dock, and hi-fi audio extension.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="modu-item">
            <b>Customization</b>
            <span>Translucent materials, woven textiles, and seasonal editions.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="modu-visual-gallery" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;">
        <div style="position:relative;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--graphite);aspect-ratio:16/9;">
          <img src="/assets/ideas/image-2-1.png" alt="MODU-PHON Slide Concept 1 - Core & Shell Architecture" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" />
          <span class="tag-badge" style="position:absolute;top:12px;left:12px;background:rgba(17,20,24,.85);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);color:#fff;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:600;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;">SLIDE 01 / ECOSYSTEM</span>
        </div>
        <div style="position:relative;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--graphite);aspect-ratio:16/9;">
          <img src="/assets/ideas/image-1-1.jpeg" alt="MODU-PHON Slide Concept 2 - Hardware Variations" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" />
          <span class="tag-badge" style="position:absolute;top:12px;left:12px;background:rgba(17,20,24,.85);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);color:#fff;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:600;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;">SLIDE 02 / HARDWARE VARIATIONS</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== CONCEPTS GRID ===== -->
  <section class="ideas-grid">

    <!-- MODU-PHON HARDWARE CONCEPT -->
    <article class="idea-card">
      <div class="img-box">
        <img src="/assets/ideas/image-2-1.png" alt="MODU-PHON Modular Core & Shell System Overview" loading="lazy" />
        <span class="tag-badge">Modular Hardware</span>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <h2>MODU-PHON — Core & Shell Architecture</h2>
        <p class="desc">A revolutionary hardware concept breaking away from static smartphone form factors. A standardized high-performance computing core slides seamlessly into purpose-built structural shells for daily, camera, audio, or outdoor use.</p>
        <div class="specs">
          <div>
            <strong>Core Architecture</strong>
            Flexible Screen + Centralized Compute Module
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Modularity</strong>
            9 Specialty Context Shells
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- MODU-PHON SLIDE OVERVIEW -->
    <article class="idea-card">
      <div class="img-box">
        <img src="/assets/ideas/image-1-1.jpeg" alt="MODU-PHON Hardware Deck Presentation" loading="lazy" />
        <span class="tag-badge">Hardware Deck</span>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <h2>MODU-PHON — Industrial Design Slides</h2>
        <p class="desc">Original presentation slides detailing context ergonomics, material selection (anodized aluminum, executive leather, bio-polymers), and heat-dissipating interface connectors.</p>
        <div class="specs">
          <div>
            <strong>Materials</strong>
            Alloy, Leather, Polymer & Woven Textile
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Interface</strong>
            High-Bandwidth Magnetic Dock
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- ECHO PERFUME BOTTLE -->
    <article class="idea-card">
      <div class="img-box">
        <img src="/assets/ideas/echo-perfume-sculpture.png" alt="ECHO Perfume Bottle Concept Sculptural Glass" loading="lazy" />
        <span class="tag-badge">Industrial Design</span>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <h2>ECHO — Perfume Sculpture</h2>
        <p class="desc">A limited-edition sculptural fragrance vessel combining high-refraction clear glass dome, cobalt liquid core, and a textured translucent red glass base with integrated ergonomic grip rings.</p>
        <div class="specs">
          <div>
            <strong>Materials</strong>
            High-refraction Glass / PE / Aluminum
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Core Innovation</strong>
            Integrated hidden atomizer & dual-fluid optics
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- ECHO PERFUME BLUEPRINT -->
    <article class="idea-card">
      <div class="img-box">
        <img src="/assets/ideas/echo-perfume-blueprint.png" alt="ECHO Perfume Technical Spec Blueprint Poster" loading="lazy" />
        <span class="tag-badge">Technical Spec</span>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <h2>ECHO — Engineering Spec</h2>
        <p class="desc">Technical blueprint section illustrating the internal fluid channel, cobalt reservoir cavity, and precision spray pump assembly encased inside the clear glass protective dome.</p>
        <div class="specs">
          <div>
            <strong>Assembly</strong>
            3-part precision snap fit
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Dispensing</strong>
            Micro-droplet integrated atomizer
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- LUMIBAMBOO AMBIENT TABLE -->
    <article class="idea-card">
      <div class="img-box">
        <img src="/assets/ideas/lumibamboo-ambient-table.png" alt="Lumibamboo Nightstand & Ambient Lamp" loading="lazy" />
        <span class="tag-badge">Furniture & Lighting</span>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <h2>Lumibamboo Ambient Nightstand</h2>
        <p class="desc">An architectural bedside nightstand blending solid walnut geometric blocks with a central reeded bamboo cane screen, housing an integrated warm ambient lighting engine.</p>
        <div class="specs">
          <div>
            <strong>Materials</strong>
            Solid Walnut & Natural Bamboo Canes
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Lighting</strong>
            Warm LED Diffused Backlight (2700K)
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- HELICAL TWIST GLASSWARE -->
    <article class="idea-card">
      <div class="img-box">
        <img src="/assets/ideas/helical-twist-glassware.png" alt="Helical Twist Glassware Chalice" loading="lazy" />
        <span class="tag-badge">Glassware</span>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <h2>Helical Twist Glassware</h2>
        <p class="desc">Experimental glassware featuring an interwoven emerald helical exoskeleton that cradles a crystal bowl, balancing structural tension with fluid elegance.</p>
        <div class="specs">
          <div>
            <strong>Craft</strong>
            Blow-molded crystal & bio-polymer cage
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Ergonomics</strong>
            Self-balancing weighted base
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

  </section>

</main>

